Cable Attachment Registry

Copyright © Summon Software Labs

Cable Attachment Registry is an open-source, vendor-neutral runtime for physical
attachment identity and topology provenance across cables, patching, ports,
endpoints and attachment lifecycle.

This product is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. See the
LICENSE file in this distribution for the full license text.

Cable Attachment Registry does not collect or transmit any telemetry. Every
record it writes is written to local files chosen by the operator and never
leaves the machine running the software.

Cable Attachment Registry accepts contributions from individuals and
organizations on the terms of the Apache License 2.0 without requiring a
Contributor License Agreement (CLA). See CONTRIBUTING.md for contribution
guidance.
